      "role": "Figure",
      "page": 4,
      "alt": "Hand-drawn concept for a foot-controlled collaborative music selector. Two people lie in bed with control strips near their feet. Annotations propose moving a foot left or right to scroll options and pointing or tapping to select. The controls include genre, station and song choices, illustrating how a couple might choose music without using their hands.",
      "actual_text": ""
    },
    {
      "element": "332:0",
      "role": "Figure",
      "page": 6,
      "alt": "Used-car shopping interface mockup. A car preview occupies the center above a pale gray timeline with owner and maintenance markers; reviews appear on the left. A yellow strip beneath the timeline contains small car-view controls for inspecting the vehicle from different angles. The timeline presents the car’s repair history, supporting inspection of its condition and wear.",
      "actual_text": ""
    },
